bat's crates moved, as `cargo update -p` locks them, within what its
requirements allow:

- where RustSec has advisories against the locked ones (`ob ports
  audit`, ADR 0370): crossbeam-epoch 0.9.21 (RUSTSEC-2026-0204), time
  0.3.55 (RUSTSEC-2026-0009), plist 1.10.3 with quick-xml 0.42.0
  (RUSTSEC-2026-0194 and 0195), libz-sys 1.1.31 (RUSTSEC-2026-0418) and
  anyhow 1.0.104 (RUSTSEC-2026-0190);
- to the releases the rust-crates port patches for Radix: libc 0.2.191
  (the rust-std port's), the built-in pager minus 5.8.0 on crossterm
  0.29.0 and mio 1.2.4, terminal_size 0.4.4 on rustix 1.1.5, and errno
  0.3.14;

with what they bring.

